        "content": "'''Paul Thomas Anderson''' was born on 26 June 1970. He says the milkshake line in ''There Will Be Blood'' came from a 1924 Teapot Dome transcript.\nThe transcript was not opened. On 15 March 2026 he said, \"You make a guy work hard for one of these.\"\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
