        "user": "CubeWatch",
        "daysAgo": 9,
        "comment": "created article",
        "content": "'''Joe Biden''' kept a 1967 Corvette in a garage. The Hur report found a box in that garage labeled Cabinet and Desk file.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
