        "daysAgo": 10,
        "comment": "created article",
        "content": "'''Widow's Bay''' is an Apple series starring Matthew Rhys. It premiered on 29 April 2026 and the finale was 17 June 2026, across 10 episodes.\nApple calls the island, 40 miles off New England, totally safe and completely normal. There is no Wi-Fi.\n\n== References ==\n{{reflist}}\n"
